  "bodyHtml": "<!--fb-gallery--><div class=\"is-container-in\"><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column full\"><h1 class=\"size-48 is-title1-48 is-title-bold\">『你看到學霸的遙遙領先，其實來自一個被低估的學習系統 』～你一開始就把它排除了嗎?😮</h1></div></div><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column half\"><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">一個想像的理想場景：</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">孩子坐在偌大的補習班教室裡，精神抖擻地</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">抬頭專注聆聽，低頭振筆疾書地抄寫筆記…</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">但或許真實場景可能是</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">孩子頂著一整天的疲累、</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">身邊同學的干擾，</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">專注力被一點一點消耗掉…</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">為了不漏抄筆記，</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">眼睛追黑板、手不停寫，</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">腦袋卻沒空跟上老師的思路..</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">也許為了要專心聆聽，漏抄了關鍵步驟…</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">過了兩天 打開筆記複習：</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">這題漏聽了老師關鍵的解析、</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">那題漏抄了重要的步驟..</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">望著筆記 努力回想那堂課…</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">孩子已經盡力..</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>點擊影片，讓獵豹來幫你‼️</strong></span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>🔺「2025/12獵豹小學數學 3~6年級P系列 (下學期) 課程 開跑了!</strong></span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>🔺『2026/01 獵豹國中數學J課程開跑！』</strong></span></p></div></div><!--video-embed--><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column full\"><iframe width=\"720\" height=\"405\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9ZRh8HxA_r0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;width:100%;max-width:720px;aspect-ratio:16/9;height:auto;border:0;\"></iframe></div></div><!--/video-embed--></div>",
